  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "v6.7.0: Sliding-window user-anchor fix + MaxMessageCount deprecation. The message-count window (MaxMessageCount, default 20) could drop the originating user query during long agentic runs (two tool messages appended per round), producing requests with no user message that some OpenAI-compatible servers reject (e.g. vLLM/Qwen 400 \"No user query found in messages\"); the window now re-anchors the most recent cut-off user message whenever the sliced window contains no user turn. AIService.MaxMessageCount is now [Obsolete] and will be removed in v7.0 — context management becomes token-based only (ConversationPolicy). Requires Mythosia.AI.Abstractions v2.4.0.",
